.TH "state.conf" "5" "August 2014" "sddm 0.21.0" "sddm"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
state.conf \- sddm display manager configuration
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.sp
~sddm/state.conf
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.sp
This file carries state configuration for the sddm display manager \fBsddm\fP(1).
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.sp
All options are configured in the [Last] section:
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \fISession=\fP
Name of the session file of the last session selected.
This session will be preselected when the login screen shows up.
Default value is empty.
.TP
.B \fIUser=\fP
Name of last logged\-in user. This username will be
preselected/shown when the login screen shows up.
Default value is empty.
.UNINDENT
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.sp
\fBsddm\fP(1)
.sp
The full documentation for sddm is available at \%<https://\:github\:.com/\:sddm/\:sddm>
